model g9_leg_hole
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-31
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #31), G9: L §5.14 Legs, E §4.2, E §9 invariant 1: a leg whose place is a hole (dest, no row) books its known side, acc_0 = 500.00 - 100.00, and every read of the unknown side is a hole naming it (bal(dest, d); a leg's field, mv_0.cash.to, isn't read: S builds no read of a leg's fields); a place the hole could stand for is no made-up place, so acc_1 stands at its opening. Invariant 1 leaves the leg out, as a leg booked by its ends. The twin mv_1 books the same leg between known places (acc_2 to acc_3, by dest2's row). tally 2.1.1 refused every ask ENGINE-INVARIANT (conservation)."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money DUK

input d0: date

input dest: key accounts

input dest2: key accounts

place acc_0: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place acc_1: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place acc_2: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place acc_3: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

move mv_0: transfers
  on d0
  leg cash from acc_0 to dest amount amt

move mv_1: transfers
  on d0
  leg cash from acc_2 to dest2 amount amt

ask a_known: bal(acc_0, 2025-01-09), bal(acc_0, 2025-01-10), bal(acc_0, 2025-01-31)

ask a_other: bal(acc_1, 2025-01-31)

ask a_hole: bal(dest, 2025-01-31)

ask a_twin: bal(acc_2, 2025-01-31), bal(acc_3, 2025-01-31)

version facts
  cite fixture
